---
import { DOWNLOAD, PRICING, SITE } from '../config/products';
const primaryHref = SITE.downloadLive ? DOWNLOAD.href : '/#notify';
---
<section class="cinema-hero shell" id="top">
  <div class="hero-topline"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> THE MULTI-VIDEO PLAYER FOR WINDOWS</p><span class="edition-label">YOUR PLAY. YOUR WAY.</span></div>
  <div class="hero-heading"><h1>One screen?<br /><span>Think bigger.</span></h1><div class="hero-intro"><p>Ultiplay is a multi-video media player for Windows. Play videos, streams, and cameras together in a grid or mosaic, across one screen or multiple monitors.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href={primaryHref} id="hero-cta" data-os-cta class="button button-light"><span data-os-cta-label>{SITE.downloadLive ? 'Download Free' : 'Get notified'}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="#pricing" class="text-link">Explore Gold <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="fineprint" data-os-note>Windows 10 / 11 · Free for up to 3 players</p></div></div>
  <figure class="hero-wall"><div class="wall-toolbar"><span><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> ULTIPLAY / MOSAIC MODE</span><a href="#commercial">Watch it in action <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><img src="/modes/mosaic.webp" alt="Ultiplay arranging landscape and portrait videos together in a full-screen mosaic" width="1600" height="900" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption><span>Your videos. Your streams. One view.</span><span>More than 3 players requires Gold.</span></figcaption></figure>
  <div class="hero-footer"><span>LOCAL FILES + LIVE STREAMS + CAMERAS</span><a href="#pricing">Go beyond three. Gold unlocks unlimited players. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>
<style>
.cinema-hero{padding-top:44px}.hero-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px}.edition-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--muted)}.hero-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:65px;align-items:end;margin:38px 0 48px}.hero-heading h1{font-size:clamp(64px,7.5vw,112px);line-height:.98;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0}.hero-heading h1 span{color:var(--gold)}.hero-intro{max-width:405px;justify-self:end;padding-bottom:4px}.hero-intro>p:first-child{font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 24px}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:23px;flex-wrap:wrap}.hero-intro .fineprint{margin:14px 0 0}.hero-wall{margin:0;background:#080909;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 30px 70px #0005}.wall-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 20px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted)}.wall-toolbar a{font-family:var(--sans);letter-spacing:0;color:var(--paper);font-size:12px}.hero-wall>img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:560px;object-fit:cover}.hero-wall figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:12px 20px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.hero-wall figcaption span:first-child{color:var(--paper)}.hero-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:25px 0 36px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hero-footer>span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted)}.hero-footer>a{font-size:13px;color:var(--gold)}@media(max-width:800px){.hero-heading{gap:28px;grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-intro{max-width:560px;justify-self:start}.hero-heading h1{font-size:clamp(64px,12vw,94px)}.edition-label{display:none}.hero-footer{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.hero-wall figcaption{flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.hero-wall>img{min-height:260px;object-fit:cover}.hero-heading{margin:32px 0}.cinema-hero{padding-top:30px}.wall-toolbar{padding:12px;font-size:9px}.wall-toolbar a{font-size:11px}}
</style>
